---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Home
permalink: /
fullBleed: true
---

<section class="relative isolate min-h-[100svh] overflow-hidden">
  <div class="signal-field text-signal" aria-hidden="true">
    {% include "partials/signal-field.njk" %}
  </div>

  <div
    class="relative z-10 mx-auto flex min-h-[100svh] max-w-6xl flex-col justify-end px-5 pb-16 pt-28 md:px-8 md:pb-20 md:pt-32"
  >
    <p class="hero-brand track-kicker mb-5">Lessons from LLM conversations</p>

    <h1
      class="hero-brand font-display text-[clamp(3.5rem,14vw,9.5rem)] font-extrabold leading-[0.86] tracking-[-0.04em] text-ink"
    >
      TilBlog
    </h1>

    <p
      class="hero-copy mt-7 max-w-xl text-pretty text-lg text-ink-soft md:text-xl"
    >
      What clicked after the chat ended — short notes, course-shaped tracks, kept for next time.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-cta mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6">
      <a class="btn-signal" href="#lessons">
        Read latest
        <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
      <a class="btn-ghost" href="#tracks">Browse tracks</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="lessons" class="border-t border-line/80 bg-foam/50">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 md:px-8 md:py-28">
    <div class="reveal mb-12 flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
      <div>
        <p class="track-kicker">Index</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-5xl">
          Latest lessons
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-sm text-ink-soft">
        One idea each. The question, the click, the rule to keep.
      </p>
    </div>

    {% if collections.posts.length %}
    <ul>
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
      <li class="reveal" style="transition-delay: {{ loop.index0 * 60 }}ms">
        <a class="post-row group grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-[5rem_1fr_auto] md:items-baseline md:gap-8" href="{{ post.url }}">
          <span class="post-row-index font-mono text-sm text-ink-soft transition">
            {{ loop.index | pad2 }}
          </span>
          <div>
            <p class="track-kicker">
              {{ post.data.track }} · {{ post.data.level }}
            </p>
            <h3 class="post-row-title mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-3xl">
              {{ post.data.title }}
            </h3>
            {% if post.data.takeaway %}
            <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-ink-soft">{{ post.data.takeaway }}</p>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
          <time class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-soft" datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">
            {{ post.date | readableDate }}
          </time>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <div class="border-t border-line/80"></div>
    {% else %}
    <p class="text-ink-soft">No posts yet. Add a Markdown file under <code class="font-mono text-sm">src/posts/</code>.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section id="tracks" class="border-t border-line/80">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 md:px-8 md:py-28">
    <div class="reveal mb-12 max-w-2xl">
      <p class="track-kicker">Curriculum without a campus</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-5xl">
        Tracks
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-ink-soft">
        Levels mark depth, not prerequisites. Follow what you’re curious about.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="reveal grid gap-0 border-t border-line/80 md:grid-cols-2">
      <li class="border-b border-line/80 py-8 md:border-r md:pr-10">
        <p class="font-mono text-sm text-signal-deep">01</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">
          Problem Solving
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-ink-soft">
          Framing, decomposition, checking your work — how to ask so the answer lands.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ink-soft">
          101 · 102 · …
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="border-b border-line/80 py-8 md:pl-10">
        <p class="font-mono text-sm text-signal-deep">02</p>
        <h3 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">
          Signal Processing
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-ink-soft">
          Filters, transforms, sampling — intuition you can carry into the next derivation.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ink-soft">
          101 · 202 · …
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
